latform's voice rather than imposing a foreign one. \u00b7 `--font-system-ui`", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "docs/DESIGN.md", "source_location": "L37"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_docs_design_eb_garamond_editorial_serif_accent_for_emphasis_moments_tight_line_height_0_90_and_700_weight_give_it_a_display_poster_quality_used_sparingly_probably_for_tagline_or_feature_emphasis_where_the_sans_serif_would_feel_too_uniform_font_eb_garamond", "label": "EB Garamond \u2014 Editorial serif accent for emphasis moments \u2014 tight line-height (0.90) and 700 weight give it a display-poster quality. Used sparingly, probably for tagline or feature emphasis where the sans-serif would feel too uniform. \u00b7 `--font-eb-garamond`", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "docs/DESIGN.md", "source_location": "L45"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_docs_design_sf_pro_text_regular_sf_pro_text_regular_detected_in_extracted_data_but_not_described_by_ai_font_sf_pro_text_regular", "label": "SF Pro Text Regular \u2014 SF Pro Text Regular \u2014 detected in extracted data but not described by AI \u00b7 `--font-sf-pro-text-regular`", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "docs/DESIGN.md", "source_location": "L53"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_docs_design_sf_pro_text_semibold_sf_pro_text_semibold_detected_in_extracted_data_but_not_described_by_ai_font_sf_pro_text_semibold", "label": "SF Pro Text Semibold \u2014 SF Pro Text Semibold \u2014 detected in extracted data but not described by AI \u00b7 `--font-sf-pro-text-semibold`", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "docs/DESIGN.md", "source_location": "L59"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_docs_design_inter_inter_detected_in_extracted_data_but_not_described_by_ai_font_inter", "label": "Inter \u2014 Inter \u2014 detected in extracted data but not described by AI \u00b7 `--font-inter`", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "docs/DES